WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:20.260
Mr. Gomez: I see three seats in the front row.

2
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.840
Jenna: Wow! Look at that stage!

3
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.280
Jenna: I can't wait to see Daisy dance.

4
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:32.070
MrsGomez: Oh good. The show's about to start!

5
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.500
Woman: Good evening, ladies and gentlemen.

6
00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:39.620
Woman: Welcome to our Winter Dance Show.

7
00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:43.480
Woman: Our first performer tonight will be Daisy Gomez!

8
00:00:43.900 --> 00:01:15.100
Mr. Gomez: That was a great show, honey.

9
00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:17.320
MrsGomez: You were wonderful.

10
00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:20.420
Jenna: I liked your dance the best.

11
00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:21.460
Miss Gray: Daisy!

12
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.460
Daisy: Miss Gray! What are you doing here?

13
00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:34.360
Miss Gray: I came to see you dance, of course.

14
00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:37.252
Jenna: Did you see her dance?

15
00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:38.519
Miss Gray: I sure did.

16
00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:39.500
She was terrific!!

17
00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:44.720
Miss Gray: Here. These are for you.

18
00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:51.200
Daisy: Flowers! They're so pretty. Thank you.

19
00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:53.540
Miss Gray: Thank you, Daisy.

20
00:01:54.516 --> 00:01:59.061
Miss Gray: Mrs. Dee told me all about Room Two last week.

21
00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:00.760
Daisy: She did?

22
00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:03.300
Jenna: Uh-oh . . .

23
00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:07.635
Miss Gray: And Mrs. Dee said that you were a big help.

24
00:02:07.636 --> 00:02:11.983
Daisy: Whew! I'm sorry about dancing during science.

25
00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:16.380
Miss Gray: I know. Now show me some of those dance moves again!

26
00:02:28.931 --> 00:02:35.027
Coby: Woo-hoo! Miss Gray is back!

27
00:02:35.028 --> 00:02:38.639
Eve: We thought you'd never come back, Miss Gray.

28
00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:40.560
Maya: It was terrible.

29
00:02:48.073 --> 00:02:58.792
Daisy: Miss Gray.

30
00:02:58.793 --> 00:03:01.402
Eve: Can I sign your cast?

31
00:03:01.403 --> 00:03:02.721
Miss Gray: Sure.

32
00:03:02.722 --> 00:03:09.345
Kids: Me too!

33
00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:11.440
Coby: How did you break your ankle anyway?

34
00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.380
Miss Gray: I was doing my favorite thing.

35
00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.580
Miss Gray: Well, my favorite thing after teaching, of course.

36
00:03:17.834 --> 00:03:19.361
Daisy: What's that?

37
00:03:19.362 --> 00:03:25.693
Miss Gray: Dancing!
